[hr][/hr]

[h1]🛠️ Mod Settings[/h1]
You can adjust mod settings directly in the game Options menu:
[list]
[*] [b]Include Temperature in "Lacks Resources" Warning:[/b] Toggle whether the yellow "Lacks Resources" warning takes your temperature limits into account (turn off for maximum late-game performance).
[*] [b]Apply Limits to Construction Materials:[/b] Toggle whether temperature limits also apply to materials delivered to build new structures (prevents using hot materials in cold-area construction).
[*] [b]Troubleshooting Reports:[/b] Generate a quick, privacy-safe report directly from the menu to help diagnose mod conflicts if anything ever behaves strangely.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]🐛 Support & Bug Reports[/h1]
If you encounter a problem or unexpected conflict, open the mod's Options in-game and choose [b]Create Support Report[/b] to generate a clean, privacy-safe diagnostic file on your machine. For elusive issues, [b]Create Extended Support Report[/b] includes a sanitized excerpt of the game log.

Nothing is ever sent over the internet automatically. You can review the file on your computer, then attach it to the [url=https://github.com/MaksymShostak/oxygen-not-included/issues/new?template=temperature-limit-bug.yml]Temperature Limit bug report form[/url] so we can help sort it out.

